        "hypothesis": "A scalar home-bucket check keeps the common lookup path cheap; when collisions continue, evaluating four consecutive probe candidates with an OpenMP SIMD minimum reduction may reduce branch-dependent lookup latency. Separate key and index arrays make the candidate fields contiguous. Selecting the earliest empty or matching slot preserves linear-probing order and first-match behavior.",
