        "depth": 1,
        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "Combining open-addressed ID lookup and tail-first per-node cost memoization should reduce repeated scans while preserving first-match lookup and float addition order. Compacting node records and separating neighbor text may also improve locality during sparse value lookups.",
        "id": "4e479a014a40495e",
